# T3: fill on workers 0 and 1, apply with gain 1 (y tile i is 5 * (i + 1)), calls of worker 0 is 1, 4; apply on 4 workers fails empty_state at rank 2. The test's g holds 3, 5; here tile+4 (4, 5), the same gain 1.
options workers 4
load ROOM 2:u32
tensor g bf16 64 32 fill tile+4
tensor x bf16 128 32 fill tile+1
tensor y bf16 128 32
invoke Gain.fill g 0:u32 on 0 2
invoke Gain.apply x y 0:u32 4:u32 1:u32 on 0 2
read y
state Gain.calls
invoke Gain.apply x y 0:u32 4:u32 1:u32 on 0 4
